        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an action game in which the jellyfish in the aquarium comfort her as she sorrows and eases her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must help the jellyfish in the tank and heal her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the time we spend together be irreplaceable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed graphics and gentle sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New voice cast added!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use with just a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this miniature antique story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821190/extras/accf2103b2ad99537ea882c6bcfc6043.avif?t=1755021632\" width=480 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▼How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I gaze calmly into the aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cheer up the jellyfish in the tank by clicking on it with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if the words don't reach you, your feelings will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▼World view</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of a sad girl and her kind jellyfish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if I raise my voice, it won't be heard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't reach it even if I reach out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I knew the answer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am just a jellyfish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla